<body>
<div type="letter">
<pb facs="3367969" n="1"/>
  <opener rend="center">
    <salute rend="center">
      <lb/>Viro Illustri
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-118656503" type="person">Danieli Bernoullio</rs>
      <lb/><abbr>S. P. D.</abbr>
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-116653582" type="person">Andreas Lamey</rs>
    </salute>
  </opener>
  <p>
      <lb/>Accipe serena fronte, quod Tibi offertur, <rs type="organisation">Socie<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tatis academic<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> Theodoro-Palatin<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></rs> instru<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>mentum, non ut Tibi honoris aliquid, sed ut
      <lb/>nobis, Te, laudatissimum virum, quantum in
      <lb/>nobis est, <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>stimasse coluisse<choice><orig><g ref="#que">&#xe8bf;</g></orig><reg>que</reg></choice>, laudis plurimum
      <lb/>accedat; siquidem ea nominis Tui claritas est
      <lb/>et existimatio, ut gratulandum omnino sit, cui Tu
      <lb/>annumerari non negas, cuivis <abbr>reip.</abbr> literari<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>
      <lb/>Collegio. Unde non dubitamus fore, quin tanto
<pb facs="3367970" n="2"/>
      <lb/>Socio <rs type="organisation">Academi<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> nostr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></rs> infantia ad summam
      <lb/>subito juventutem emersisse videatur. Vale,
      <lb/>Vir Amplissime, Musis<choice><orig><g ref="#que">&#xe8bf;</g></orig><reg>que</reg></choice> Palatinis, nunc etiam
      <lb/>Tuis, ac illarum interpreti, quantumvis inepto,
      <lb/>pro Tua humanitate, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> summa est, fave.
  </p>
  <closer>
    <dateline>
      <lb/><abbr>Dab.</abbr> <rs key="place_GEO-2873891" type="place">Mannhemi<choice><orig><g ref="#j">j</g></orig><reg>i</reg></choice></rs> <date when="1767-05-10">VI. Id. Mai<choice><orig><g ref="#j">j</g></orig><reg>i</reg></choice> <subst><del>D</del><add>M</add></subst>DCCLXVII</date><choice><orig>,</orig><reg>.</reg></choice>
    </dateline>
  </closer>
